Sun Nov 22 20:11:37 UTC 2026 - Stefan Hundhammer <Stefan.Hundhammer@gmx.de>

- Update to version 2.0.1:
  * Version bump to 2.0.1
  * Handle restricted mode in mouseReleaseEvent, too
  * Updated copyright year
  * Whitespace cleanup
  * Removed redundant code
  * Restricted mode for irresponsible users
  * Write tail-log script to log dir
  * Removed unused variable
  * Unify whitespace because GitHub is too dumb to handle it
  * Don't crash in cache file error handling (Closes #326)
  * Coding style
  * cleaned it up
  * fix crash on reading invalid cache file
  * qdirstat-cache-writer: compress using piped gzip
  * Disable native macOS menu bar
  * Allow moveToTrash() only with well-defined active window (#320)
  * Avoid native file dialogs (issue #320)
  * Removed dead code
  * Removed obsolete references to own moveToTrash() implementation
  * Keep for future use
  * Replace Trash class with QFile::moveToTrash
  * metainfo: add missing release information
  * Doc + (c) update
  * Mark 'Donate' dialog heading for translation (#318)
  * Merge duplicate msgids
  * Don't mark sample text in .ui files and Fn keys for translation
  * Get rid of msgctxt in .pot file (#319)
  * Don't translate empty message into gibberish
  * Greatly simplify 'makepot' to be more robust
  * Use .cpp files, not .cc files (#318)
  * Fixed typo (Closes #317)
  * Factored out platform-specific main win UI things to a central place
  * Fixed yet another C++20 incompatibility with itself
  * Work around yet another new GCC warning causing trouble in upstream Qt
  * Removed obsolete Qt5 compatibility now that Qt6 is required anyway
  * Add File > New Instance action (macOS only)
  * Fix opening URLs on macOS (use open, not xdg-open)
  * New widget sizes suitable for Qt6 generated by Qt Designer6
  * Let Qt Designer6 generate the new enum types where needed
  * Added QAction menu roles where appropriate as suggested by @kk1987 in #314
  * Fixed typo in Treemap.md
  * Prevent Data volume duplicates
  * Prepare for installing @oliver's new Python script if needed
  * format script with "black"
  * show help output when supplying wrong number of parameters
  * write results to specified file rather than to stdout
  * add some sanity checks, to detect obvious input errors
  * initial snapshot of scripts/rclone2qdirstat.py
  * operator<<() overload for unsigned long long for armv7 FreeBSD by @clausecker (closes #301)
  * Typo
  * Fix build on BSD (Closes #299)
  * Imported packaging files from OBS + post-release version bump

