Sun Jan 18 17:46:37 UTC 2026 - Stefan Hundhammer <shundhammer@suse.com>

- Update to version 2.0:
  * Change log and version bump to 2.0
  * Suppress Qt bullshit messages that keep flooding the log
  * No duplicate %d in 'open with filemanager here' std cleanup (Closes #297)
  * Added missing section end
  * Document current development status
  * Use imported Myrlyn Translator class
